        "tab_details": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": true,
            "heading": "Product Details",
            "icon": "paw_print",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Structured carrier backpack</strong> - front legs go through leg holes and buckle into a harness; the body sits in a cushioned, zippered compartment; the head stays out the top.</li><li><strong>360° breathable mesh</strong> side panels for airflow in every season</li><li><strong>Padded, adjustable shoulder straps</strong> built for your comfort too</li><li><strong>Reflective trim</strong> for low-light visibility</li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> two exterior pockets plus one adjustable/expandable pocket</li><li><strong>Thickened cushioned base</strong> for support and comfort</li><li><strong>Material:</strong> durable polyester shell with reinforced stitching</li><li><strong>Sizes:</strong> S, M, L, XL - fits dogs from 1kg to 30kg</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_sizeguide": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "📏 Size Guide - find your dog's fit",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "content": "<p>Measure your dog's weight and back length, then match the chart. Between two sizes? Size up for room to move.</p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0896/9984/4467/files/S18e816b04db24772b8b7aeac6e5917d3a.webp\" alt=\"SecureRide Dog Carrier Backpack size chart showing S, M, L and XL weight and length ranges\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0\" loading=\"lazy\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px\"><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px\">Size</th><th style=\"text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px\">Weight</th><th style=\"text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px\">Back length</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:6px\">S</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">1-5 kg</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">42 cm / 16.9 in</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px\">M</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">4-9 kg</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">48 cm / 19.7 in</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px\">L</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">8-18 kg</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">57 cm / 22.8 in</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px\">XL</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">16-30 kg</td><td style=\"padding:6px\">68 cm / 26.8 in</td></tr></tbody></table>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_how": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "How It Works",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<ol><li><strong>Front legs through the harness holes</strong> - guide each front leg through its leg hole.</li><li><strong>Buckle the harness</strong> - clip the buckle so the harness holds securely.</li><li><strong>Zip the compartment closed</strong> around your dog's body.</li><li><strong>Head stays out the top</strong> - your dog can see, breathe, and enjoy the ride.</li></ol><p>Tip: let your dog get used to it with a few minutes at home before your first outing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
