        },
        "t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Feel your dog settle in instantly. The <strong>buckled SecureRide harness</strong> holds their front legs secure and supported, so they ride steady on every bike ride, hike, and walk.</p><p>Hands-free carrying that keeps you both moving - no more choosing between your adventures and your dog.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
