        "title": "Built for the dog first",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>Don't settle for a \"one size fits most\" carrier that pinches, sags, or overheats.</p><p>Choose <strong>SecureRide</strong> for a secure, breathable, true-to-size fit your dog will actually want to ride in.</p>",
