    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I know which size to order?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Measure your dog's weight and check the size chart in the buy box (or the Size Guide tab). If your dog is between two sizes, we recommend sizing up. Not sure? Message us before you order and we'll help you pick. Free size exchange within 30 days either way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can my dog escape or fall out?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Your dog's front legs go through the harness and buckle securely in place, and the main compartment zips closed around their body. As with any carrier, supervise your dog closely for the first few uses while they get used to it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will my dog overheat in the backpack?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The 360° mesh panels are designed to let heat escape, so your dog gets airflow even on warm days. On hot days, take the same breaks and bring the same water you would on any walk or ride.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it machine washable?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We recommend spot cleaning or hand washing in cold water and air drying. Avoid machine washing and tumble drying to protect the padding and mesh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if my dog doesn't take to it right away?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Most dogs need a short adjustment period with any new gear. Try a few minutes at home before your first outing. If it's still not right for your dog, you're covered by our 30-day money-back guarantee.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which sizes and weights does it fit?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Four true sizes: S (1-5kg), M (4-9kg), L (8-18kg), and XL (16-30kg). See the Size Guide for back-length measurements too.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What colors are available?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The SecureRide comes in Blue, Black, Red, Orange, Dark Gray, and Light Gray. Pick your color right in the buy box.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does shipping take?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Orders ship within 2-5 business days and most deliveries arrive in about 7-15 business days depending on your location.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it good for bike rides?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes - cycling is one of the SecureRide's core uses. The buckled harness holds your dog steady and the head-out design lets them enjoy the ride. Start on quiet routes while your dog gets comfortable.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
